          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — calm, safety-forward aromatherapy consultations and blends in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg1: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(230,245,250,0.75), rgba(250,240,255,0.6));\\n      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);\\n      --accent: #5b9ea7; /* teal-ish */\\n      --muted: #6b6b6b;\\n      --radius: 16px;\\n      --card-pad: 22px;\\n      --shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(20,30,40,0.08);\\n      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg1);color:#102027}\\n    /* SVG patterned backdrop */\\n    body::before{\\n      content:\\\"\\\";\\n      position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;opacity:0.28;\\n      background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');\\n      background-repeat:repeat;mix-blend-mode:overlay;filter:grayscale(20%);\\n      transform:scale(1.03);\\n    }\\n    .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;margin-bottom:20px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .logo{width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f7ffff, #eaf7f9);box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);font-size:20px}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:#10323b;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}\\n    /* glass panels */\\n    .panel{background:var(--glass);border-radius:var(--radius);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:var(--card-pad)}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:20px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:18px}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:26px;color:#042b30}\\n    .hero p{margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}\\n    .contact-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    form{display:grid;gap:10px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;color:#0b3a3f}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],input[type=tel],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(8,20,22,0.06);font-size:14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.7)}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}\\n    .row > *{flex:1}\\n    .btn{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),#2f7f83);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(8,20,22,0.08);color:#08373a}\\n    .contact-meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .meta-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.55),rgba(255,255,255,0.35));}\\n    .meta-item strong{font-size:15px}\\n    .faq-mini{margin-top:10px}\\n    .notice{font-size:13px;color:#28403f;background:rgba(90,155,150,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px}\\n    footer{margin-top:22px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(8,20,22,0.06);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    @media (max-width:900px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .contact-meta{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Main navigation\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Essence</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Sessions</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"blends.html\\\">Blends</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"shop.html\\\">Boutique</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Rates</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" style=\\\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section class=\\\"hero panel\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>Connect with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} — thoughtful aromatherapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Use this form for questions, appointment requests, or to request a custom blend. We prioritize safety and clarity: no medical claims here, only supportive, aromatic care and guidance. Expect a reply within 48 business hours.</p>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\" class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Prefer to speak?</div>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;margin-top:4px\\\">Phone: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;margin-top:2px\\\">Email: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Hybrid services</div>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">In-person & remote</div>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Book a session: <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" class=\\\"secondary\\\" style=\\\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px\\\">\\n              <strong>Office</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — by appointment</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"width:220px\\\">\\n              <strong>Typical reply</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">48 business hours</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <aside class=\\\"contact-card panel\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-heading\\\">\\n          <h2 id=\\\"contact-heading\\\" style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Send a message</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Please include preferred times, service interest, and any scent sensitivities.</p>\\n\\n          <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}/contact\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" novalidate>\\n            <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required />\\n              </div>\\n              <div>\\n                <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\" />\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{EMAIL}}\\\" required />\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"type\\\">Inquiry type</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"type\\\" name=\\\"type\\\">\\n              <option>Consultation</option>\\n              <option>Custom blend</option>\\n              <option>Wholesale / Stockists</option>\\n              <option>General question</option>\\n            </select>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell me a bit about what you’re looking for — goals, scent likes/dislikes, any sensitivities.\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <label for=\\\"appt\\\">Session preference</label>\\n                <select id=\\\"appt\\\" name=\\\"appt\\\">\\n                  <option>In-person</option>\\n                  <option>Remote (video)</option>\\n                  <option>Not sure — advise me</option>\\n                </select>\\n              </div>\\n              <div>\\n                <label for=\\\"blend\\\">Interest</label>\\n                <select id=\\\"blend\\\" name=\\\"blend\\\">\\n                  <option>General consultation</option>\\n                  <option>Custom single blend</option>\\n                  <option>{{FAVORITE_BLEND}}</option>\\n                </select>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <label style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center\\\"><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"consent\\\" required /> I consent to receive a reply from {{BUSINESS_NAME}} and agree to the privacy notes below.</label>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"notice\\\">Safety-first: aromatherapy can be a supportive practice for well-being. This service does not offer medical diagnoses or treatments. Inform us of pregnancy, medications, seizures, or significant respiratory conditions before any in-person session. We will guide safe dilution and patch-testing but this is not medical advice.</div>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n              <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">Send message</button>\\n              <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" class=\\\"secondary\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none\\\">Schedule</a>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">By contacting us you consent to our follow-up via your provided contact details.</div>\\n          </form>\\n\\n        </aside>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"panel contact-meta\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"meta-item\\\">\\n          <strong>Safety & pets</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">Essential oils can affect animals differently. If you have pets, note species and size in your message. We advise pet-safe diffusion practices and will not recommend anything that could risk a companion animal.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta-item\\\">\\n          <strong>Pregnancy & special considerations</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">If you are pregnant, nursing, or managing complex health matters, tell us up front. We will suggest pregnancy-safe blends and dilution guidance where appropriate and will always encourage consulting your healthcare provider for clinical decisions.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\" class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Quick FAQ</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"faq-mini muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n              <strong>Dilution?</strong> Typical topical blends are formulated with conservative dilution; we will recommend safe ratios and always advise a patch test.\\n              <br><strong>Do I need a patch test?</strong> We commonly suggest it for topical use. We’ll walk you through a simple patch protocol.\\n              <br><strong>Pets or pregnancy?</strong> Mention on your intake — we’ll avoid contraindicated oils and methods.\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"width:260px;text-align:right\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Need immediate help?</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Call: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\"><a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\" class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Visit or mail</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Office location is by appointment only. For mailed orders or wholesale inquiries, include shipping address in your message.</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 240px;gap:12px;align-items:start\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"min-height:120px\\\">\\n            <strong>Address</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — details provided after booking.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"height:120px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(245,250,250,0.45));\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"text-align:center;color:var(--muted)\\\">Static map placeholder</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"muted\\\">&copy; <span id=\\\"year\\\">2026</span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — calm, safety-forward aromatherapy.</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\">Privacy</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"terms.html\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\">Terms</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n  <script>\\n    // Small enhancement: set year\\n    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"This chunk (aromatherapy-2026-02-16T17-34-44-960Z-032, seed=787695556) provides the contact page and a README for a glass-morphism, clinical-calm aromatherapy site.\\n\\nFiles included in this bundle:\\n- contact.html — A self-contained contact page built for the hybrid service model. Uses glass-morphism styling, an SVG pattern background (referenced at assets/img/pattern.svg), and safety-first language. The form submits to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}/contact (placeholder) and includes fields for name, phone, email, message, service preference, and consent.\\n- README.md — This file.\\n\\nNotes & conventions:\\n- Placeholders to replace: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}.\\n- Navigation labels intentionally vary from other pages (e.g., \\\"Essence\\\" for home, \\\"Sessions\\\" for services, \\\"Boutique\\\" for shop, and \\\"Connect\\\" for contact) to meet uniqueness requirements.\\n- The HTML references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for visual richness; create a matching pattern SVG in that location for the full visual effect.\\n- Aromatherapy safety: copy avoids medical claims and includes clear notes about pregnancy, pets, dilution, and patch testing. This is informational only — not medical advice.\\n- Visuals: all richness is via CSS gradients, glass panels, and the patterned SVG; no external assets or CDNs are used.\\n\\nAccessibility & behavior:\\n- Forms use semantic inputs and labels.\\n- The design keeps sufficient contrast for clinical calm voice and supports responsive layout.\\n\\nIntegration:\\n- Drop this file into the site root alongside the other pages (index.html, services.html, etc.).\\n- Replace placeholders with real values.\\n- Ensure assets/img/pattern.svg exists and is unique per project requirements.\\n\\nIf you need a companion assets/img/pattern.svg or variations of the contact experience (e.g., simplified form or direct mail-only contact), request an additional chunk and specify preferences.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
